    "<p class=\"muted\">Target MRR is available through the per-query reciprocal-rank details.</p>": "<p class=\"muted\">目标排名 MRR 可在逐题详情的目标排名倒数中核对。</p>",
    "A first upstream result may contain too few or off-topic items. The extra wait is an observed scheduling interval, not a proven removable speedup. Any early-stop policy must be tested against the same quality requirements.": "首个上游结果可能条数不足或不相关。“继续等待”是已观测到的调度时段，不是可直接削掉的耗时。提前结束策略仍需在相同质量要求下验证。",
    "A real query: inspect each rank and its score": "查看一道实际查询的逐条评分与计算",
    "A source hit means at least one published supporting URL appears in the top {cutoff}. MRR averages reciprocal first-hit rank: 1 for rank one, 0.5 for rank two and zero for a miss. Answer cues use only shared titles and snippets. Failures, empties and short lists remain in the population.": "前 {cutoff} 条中找到题库列出的任一支持网址，就记一次来源命中。MRR 是首个命中位置的倒数：第 1 条得 1，第 2 条得 0.5，未命中得 0，再对全部题取平均。答案线索只检查各接口共有的标题与短摘要。失败、空结果和不足 {cutoff} 条都保留，不补齐、不换题。",
