    "All": "全部",
    "All declared calls remain in the headline latency. Cache states come from the API response; unknown means the provider did not report one. The first round is not guaranteed to be a cold cache. Repeated queries describe reuse behavior, not sustained-load throughput.": "首页耗时保留全部预定调用。缓存标记直接取自接口响应；unknown 表示接口没有提供，不能据此判断是否缓存。第一轮也不保证冷缓存。重复查询反映复用表现，不代表持续负载下的吞吐量。",
    "All declared physical calls": "全部预定调用",
    "All findings adjudicated; unresolved: 0.": "全部发现已完成裁决，未处理项：0。",
    "All logical requests with available telemetry are included; n states the available population. Server time is provider-reported and unavailable where no comparable field exists. The remainder includes network transit and client setup; it is not pure network latency. Requests that received no first byte contribute only to total latency, not to TTFB or body-transfer means. TTFB and body transfer are sequential; DNS/connect/TLS clocks are cumulative and must not be added.": "有遥测数据的题目均计入，n 是该项可用样本数。服务端耗时取自接口报告；没有可比字段时不填。其余耗时包含网络往返和客户端启动，不等于纯网络延迟。未收到首字节的请求只计总耗时，不计首字节和正文传输均值。首字节与正文传输先后发生；DNS、连接、TLS 计时为累计值，不能相加。",
    "All outcome relations": "全部结果",
    "All queries": "全部题目",
    "All questions": "总体",
    "All saved responses · {cases}": "全部响应 · {cases}",
