    "All-call latency includes failures and every declared round. P50 is the median; P95 uses nearest rank. Quality uses only the preselected first round. A known-page miss is not proof of irrelevant results.": "耗时包含失败和预定的所有轮次。P50 为中位数，P95 取最近秩百分位数。命中指标仅使用预定的第一轮；没命中已知目标页，不等于其他结果不相关。",
    "Allowed official sources and verification links": "本题允许的官方来源与核验依据",
    "Answer": "跨页答案",
    "Answer Match@{cutoff} (text)": "Answer Match@{cutoff}（文字）",
    "Answer checks match published answer text and exclude benchmark records.": "答案检查匹配公开参考答案文字，并排除评测记录。",
    "Answer checks use the published answer, explicit aliases and allowed numeric ranges, preserving units and percentage modifiers. Matches stay within one returned field; fields are never joined. Unspecified synonyms are not inferred. Negated or unrelated mentions can still match, so this is lexical evidence rather than semantic accuracy. Details expose the reference answer, sources and actual output.": "答案检查使用题库明确列出的答案、别名和允许数值范围，并保留单位、百分号等数量含义；只在单个返回字段内匹配，不跨字段拼接。未明确给出的同义说法不会推断为命中。否定句或无关上下文仍可能误中，因此这是文字证据检查，不是语义正确率。逐题页可核对标准答案、来源与实际输出。",
    "Answer cue in delivered text · contamination excluded": "返回文字中的答案线索",
    "Answer cues use every delivered title, snippet, summary and body in the top {cutoff}.": "答案线索检查各家前 {cutoff} 条实际交付的标题、短摘要、长摘要和正文。",
    "Answer cues use only shared titles and snippets.": "答案线索只检查各接口共有的标题与短摘要。",
    "Answer in all text": "全部文字出现答案",
    "Answer in preview": "短摘要／标题出现答案",
    "Answer matching normalizes Unicode, case and punctuation and requires consecutive whole tokens within one field. Negated or unrelated mentions can match; paraphrases can miss. These are source and lexical checks, not semantic accuracy. Every detail exposes the answer, sources and output.": "答案检查统一 Unicode、大小写及标点，要求完整词组在单个字段中连续出现；不会跨字段拼出答案。否定句或无关上下文可能误中，同义表达可能漏计。因此本表是来源与文字证据检查，不是语义正确率。所有题的标准答案、来源和实际输出均可在逐题页核对。",
