    "Each column shows the first five results with their returned titles and snippets.": "每列展示前 5 条结果及接口返回的标题、摘要。",
    "Each metric shows its eligible query count. Hit@{cutoff} and MRR use declared known pages; domain fraction uses returned top-{cutoff} URLs and is unavailable for empty responses. Native source and site operators implement the same intent through different routes.": "每项指标标明适用题数。Hit@{cutoff} 和 MRR 只核对预定的已知页面；域名占比以实际返回的前 {cutoff} 条为分母，空响应不记为满足约束。原生来源参数和 site 算子是同一意图的不同调用方式。",
    "Each query receives one primary category: API error, empty list, off-domain result, then known-page discovery. A result that finds its target but leaks another domain is counted as off-domain here; the separate known-page metric still counts it as a hit. Missing the target does not make other pages irrelevant.": "此表每题只归一类：接口错误、空结果、域名不符、已知目标。找到目标页却混入其他域名的题会归入“域名不符”，所以这里的“命中已知目标”可能少于上方独立的目标页命中数。未命中目标不等于其他结果无关。",
